// Base Cloudflare Workers config. `npm run build` (Nitro) merges this into the
// generated .output/server/wrangler.json and points Wrangler at it, so a plain
// `npx wrangler deploy` from the project root ships the built app.
//
// Only publishable values belong here — they mirror .env, which is committed.
